OL,3,GNEWSAFour in court over murder of
OL,4,Anewborn baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe baby's mother, Andrea Skopova, 20,
OL,7,Fappeared earlier at Sheffield Crown
OL,8,FCourt along with Peter Horvath, 19,
OL,9,FPeter Horvath, 38, and Nina Horvathova,
OL,10,F37, all charged with murder. A
OL,11,F15-year-old girl charged with
OL,12,Fperverting the course of justice also
OL,13,Fappeared.
OL,15,FNo pleas were entered by the defendants
OL,16,Fon Friday and a further hearing was
OL,17,Ffixed for 14 December.
